{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"2597080","name":"墨境","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/3eb50ef06f758e65eb61ec98e5637c10.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“它是天道？无所谓，我照杀不误。”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">你意外发现自己的命运被所谓的&quot;天道&quot;掌控，只有逃离这个世界，才有可能获得真正的自由。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">黄粱一梦，猝然而醒：<strong>“我虽凡尘微末，也当以剑代笔，纵横天下，快意人生！”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/d4df1ca479fdaf69c813fddfdbd99815.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1200 height=190 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">《墨境》×《苍翼：混沌效应》联动开启</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">全新形态「奥莉朵‌」上线</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">混沌破境，挥墨而战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2f4586674e390a610907677b7e90e60e.poster.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2f4586674e390a610907677b7e90e60e.webm?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/2f4586674e390a610907677b7e90e60e.mp4?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/99166c5266b11516c2532a19ba351d4e.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>护肝神游，肉眼可见的变强</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你将扮演侠女丹朱，穿过危机四伏的禁地“荒墟”，挑战各有过往的boss以及最终的“禁忌存在”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >逃离恒常不变的&quot;墨境&quot;世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>以剑指天，改写天意！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/97d16f355f2ecb23749bd5f945452358.poster.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/97d16f355f2ecb23749bd5f945452358.webm?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/97d16f355f2ecb23749bd5f945452358.mp4?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/1fc28d91c98b66568a9c77547ba960ff.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >道具繁多，构筑轻松上手</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11+“画皮”玩法：切换多种战斗形态，燃魂激战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+“墨宝”玩法：组建丰富的墨宝组合，百策克敌。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+“奇珍”玩法：自由搭配奇珍道具，创意无限。此外，还有特殊NPC、特殊房间、无尽模式等”魔性“挑战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >万法随心，纵横墨境！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/731e22803088e17d37d98e2b1a7a5d2b.poster.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/731e22803088e17d37d98e2b1a7a5d2b.webm?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/731e22803088e17d37d98e2b1a7a5d2b.mp4?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/01547f255a32cff043d86caa319b0b21.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >打不过没关系，你的宠物会出手！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >根据多种墨宝组合，使宠物进化出15+不同形态，应用独特招式辅助作战。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >灵宠相伴，共斩神魔！霸气灵宠你带飞！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/cfa170d12a98ba4cd0d8e55cf2676a65.poster.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/cfa170d12a98ba4cd0d8e55cf2676a65.webm?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/cfa170d12a98ba4cd0d8e55cf2676a65.mp4?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/8585f913c7d0602e5a9a1da57b5abda3.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >欢迎来到这韵味无穷的水墨世界！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在竹林，雪原，佛山，水乡，空谷，古国，幽海，枯冢……邂逅狐妖、花精、镜魅等20+国风精怪角色，提升他们的好感度，解锁专属故事和更亲密的约会事件。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >氤氲天地，墨色探险！缘起缘灭，逍遥世间！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/bc118457fa103e78574579ee00a2d24d.poster.avif?t=1779883730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/bc118457fa103e78574579ee00a2d24d.webm?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/bc118457fa103e78574579ee00a2d24d.mp4?t=1779883730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/43a87a1f8a22bde590d2f72f84b63be56da7e753/header_schinese.jpg?t=1779883730","website":"","developers":["Leap Studio"],"publishers":["4Divinity"],"release_date":"2026 年 5 月 26 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"EUR","initial":"24.99","final":"22.49","discount":10},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 繁体中文<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","支持字幕","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","冒险","独立","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64位<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i3+<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 8 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 100% DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64位<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 8 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 100% DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https: